    "Revives itself over and over with the \"Anja Serenade\" in its heart.": "Revive una y otra vez con la «Anja Serenade» de su corazón.",
    "Revs up its Chainsaw and slashes the enemy with it.": "Acelera su Chainsaw y corta con ella al enemigo.",
    "Rides the drill of its tail and spins itself, striking the opponent with its body.": "Monta sobre el taladro de su cola y gira, golpeando al oponente con su cuerpo.",
